				item: "create:shaft"
				count: 10
			}]
		}
		{
			x: 3.0d
			y: -3.0d
			description: [
				"如前所述，&b齿轮&r（或 Cog）可以&a传递和操控旋转力&r。"
				"&bCogs&r的连接方式相当简单：&bSmall Cogs&r可以呈+形连接（即连接在四个基本方向以及中心轴上）。&bLarge and Small Cogs&r可以斜向连接，也可以连接在中心轴上。"
				"If you connect the shafts of a &bSmall&r and then a &bLarge Cog&r, it will &aincrease the speed&r of the rotation. These can be &dstacked multiple times&r, by &6placing a second Small Cog at the diagonal&r of the Large Cog, and then another Large Cog at its shaft. You can continue this as many times as you have space for."
			]
			dependencies: ["1EB53FD55A3973BF"]
			id: "0B539C0958C0AE9F"
			tasks: [{
				id: "04B84E2B75613645"
				type: "item"
				item: "create:cogwheel"
			}]
			rewards: [{
				id: "3E7EC968C6E711AF"
				type: "item"
				item: "create:cogwheel"
				count: 5
			}]
		}
		{
			x: 3.0d
			y: -4.5d
			description: [
				"如前所述，&b齿轮&r（或 Cog）可以&a传递和操控旋转力&r。"
				"&bCogs&r的连接方式相当简单：&bLarge Cogs&r相互垂直连接，让你无需&bGearbox&r就能&a将水平旋转转为垂直旋转&r（更多细节稍后说明）。&bLarge and Small Cogs&r可以斜向连接，也可以在轴上连接。"
				"特别是&b大型齿轮&r很有用，因为它们可以连接到&b转速控制器&r的顶部，让你能够&6自定义后续机器的每分钟转数 - rpm - &r。"
				"If you connect the shafts of a &bSmall&r and then a &bLarge Cog&r, it will &aincrease the speed&r of the rotation. These can be &dstacked multiple times&r, by &6placing a second Small Cog at the diagonal&r of the Large Cog, and then another Large Cog at its shaft. You can continue this as many times as you have space for."
			]
			dependencies: ["1EB53FD55A3973BF"]
			id: "053309454320882E"
			tasks: [{
				id: "624F3254100ED18D"
				type: "item"
